+		// view a small centre window on the iPad's screen, so on
+		// iOS the docks are sized from the actual window size:
+		// side panels ~16-17% of the width, output panel ~12%
+		// of the height, and the document view takes everything
+		// else. The left tab group (Project/Model/Post/Monitor
