+		// back to the constructor's size-hint layout — the
+		// Build panel claiming about half the width, the
+		// Output panel about a third of the height, and the
+		// 3D view reduced to a 464x267 pt strip on the
+		// 1180x820 pt screen (device Log, patch 0018). The
+		// sizing therefore runs on EVERY launch, after the
